  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solarization of Malakal Teaching Hospital</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Malakal Technical Hospital (MTH) is the main health facility in the area and was a fully developed Level 4 hospital until the civil war broke out in 2013. The hospital was destroyed during the war and has recently commenced basic operations. The overall objective of this project is to improve the hospitals efficiency in providing health services to patients living in the POC site by supporting the MTH with a solar plus storage system, made in close consultation with the humanitarian organizations operating in the health sector in Malakal.</narrative>
  </description>
